                        "email": "prithvi24pai@gmail.com",
                        "username": "PrithviPai24"
                    },
                    "message": "And also can we have more description on who implements this ?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Thu Nguyen",
                        "email": "thu@os.amperecomputing.com",
                        "username": "ThuBaNguyen"
                    },
                    "message": "I think the commit message already mention about this\n```\nCheck the Redfish HostInterface schema [2], there are three properties\n`EnableAfterReset`, `Enabled` and `RoleId`. These properties are used to\nresponse for Redfish HostInterface requests. This properties are hosted\nby phopshor-user-manager. The values of the properties in the interface\nare updated by phosphor-ipmi-host when handling ipmi command `Get\nbootstrap account credentials (NetFn 2Ch, Command 02h)`.\n\n```"
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/HostInterface/CredentialBootstrapping.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 17,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Prithvi Pai",
                        "email": "prithvi24pai@gmail.com",
                        "username": "PrithviPai24"
                    },
                    "message": "Should this not be readonly ?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/HostInterface/CredentialBootstrapping.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 17,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Thu Nguyen",
                        "email": "thu@os.amperecomputing.com",
                        "username": "ThuBaNguyen"
                    },
                    "message": "No, the enabled will be updated to false when user call `Get bootstrap account credentials` with `credential bootstrapping control:` is not 0xA5 as DSP0270 spec."
                }
            ],
